*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0003
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 509
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0003.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CLM0003C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 SETTLE-AMT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    05 CLAIM-STATUS       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM PAYOUT-RULES
    DISPLAY "SETTLE-AMT=" SETTLE-AMT
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-STATUS=" CLAIM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.
PAYOUT-RULES.
    *> MEDICAL CO-INSURANCE
    IF CLM-TYPE-CD = 'M'
        COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLAIM-VALUE * 0.80
    ELSE
        *> DEDUCTIBLE APPLIES
        IF CLAIM-VALUE > 0
            COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLAIM-VALUE - POLICY-DEDUCT
        ELSE
            MOVE 0 TO SETTLE-AMT
            MOVE 'D' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-IF.
